  "description": "A stock that meets buying requirements and we dive into Oil and Natural Gas Prices",
  "body_html": "<p>The market was pumping up as soon as 2026 started, yet has been taking a breather the last 2 days. Nothing too scary, no major asset crashes and the VIX remains below 21 at 15.3. In this episode I share a stock that is looking pretty decent, Compass Inc. We also dive into oil and natural gas prices. No! I am not a Venezuela expert or oil guru. But I do …</p>",
